---
layout: null
---
{%- comment -%}
Consumer: the Automated Build Server (external/build_server, appInfoURL in
utils.mjs), fetched at the start of every build run. Everything in api/ is read
by software outside the site; keep fields stable and tell the consumer's owner
before changing them.

Per platform and appId, the `builds` block of every wallet record that has one:
which architectures and package types the server builds and the filename
patterns that map the resulting assets.
{%- endcomment -%}
{
  "hardware": {
    {% assign hardware_with_builds = site.hardware | where_exp: "item", "item.builds" %}
    {% for post in hardware_with_builds %}
    "{{ post.appId }}": {
      "builds": {{ post.builds | jsonify }}
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{% endfor %}
  },
  "desktop": {
    {% assign desktop_with_builds = site.desktop | where_exp: "item", "item.builds" %}
    {% for post in desktop_with_builds %}
    "{{ post.appId }}": {
      "builds": {{ post.builds | jsonify }}
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{% endfor %}
  },
  "android": {
    {% assign android_with_builds = site.mobile | where_exp: "item", "item.android.builds" %}
    {% for post in android_with_builds %}
    "{{ post.android.appId }}": {
      "builds": {{ post.android.builds | jsonify }}
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{% endfor %}
  }
}
